Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 22:43:34 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] DSH's browser shows agents calls in its native Tool card
 (527)

graftling-dsh's client module no longer registers a tool.call.toolview view
(AgentsRow with its Details button) for mcp__graftling__agents or the older
mcp__agents__agents, so both use the collapsible card DSH shows for every
other tool, as mcp__graphtraj__agents already does. The incoming
agent-message attribution on conversation.chat.node stays. The client no
longer injects @deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-tool, which owns only the slot that
view used; slots comes from dsh-client-ui-renderer and the chat node from
dsh-client-ui-chat, both still injected. Version unchanged; CHANGELOG
Unreleased and README updated.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
